OL,3,AAlison Hammond: 'I thought I was having
OL,4,Aheart attack on air'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlison Hammond has said she feared she
OL,7,Fwas having a heart attack on air when
OL,8,Fshe had to rush off ITV's This Morning
OL,9,Fmidway through the programme last week.
OL,11,FThe presenter appeared to clutch her
OL,12,Fchest as she left the show last Friday,
OL,13,Fand was taken to hospital to have a
OL,14,Fheart check-up.
OL,16,FShe turned out to have suffered a panic
OL,17,Fattack, and said the experience was
OL,18,F"probably one of the most scariest
OL,19,Fthings I've ever been through".
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/18
