OL,3,AAlison Hammond: 'I thought I was having
OL,4,Aheart attack on air'
OL,5,
OL,6,FReturning for her weekly slot on
OL,7,FFriday, she told viewers: "I couldn't
OL,8,Fcatch my breath and I genuinely thought
OL,9,FI was having a heart attack. I'm so
OL,10,Fglad I'm here. I feel so grateful. I
OL,11,Ffeel so thankful to God, to everything
OL,12,Fin life."
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/18
