OL,3,AOlivia Colman on viral Wicker memes:
OL,4,A'This has never happened to me before'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt has already been described as 2026's
OL,7,Fweirdest rom-com.
OL,9,FAnd new film Wicker has sparked a
OL,10,Fdeluge of viral memes and steamy jokes
OL,11,Fthat have flooded social media ahead of
OL,12,Fits release.
OL,14,FSpeaking to the BBC at its London Film
OL,15,FFestival premiere, lead star Olivia
OL,16,FColman said she never expected such a
OL,17,Fbig reaction.
OL,19,F"No, literally this has never happened
OL,20,Ffor anything I've done before," she
OL,21,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/18
